{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Letters to Arralla's charming soundtrack is a family favourite and our go-to recipe for a refreshing summer salad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ingredients:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 1 cup Enya</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 1/2 cup Eastshade</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 2 tbsp Weetbix commercials</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 1  Alba: A Wildlife Adventure, finely chopped</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 1 tbsp Fleet Foxes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 1 bar of handmade eucalyptus soap</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 1 sprig of My Chemical Romance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 250g odd briefs (any of &quot;stoners jamming in a garage&quot;, &quot;scientist husbands arguing via academic paper&quot;, or &quot;alien shoujo weeb&quot; will do)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Method:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toss all ingredients into one playlist and listen! We hope you enjoy :)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4012800?t=1759184567","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4012800?t=1759184567","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012800/a5a936cd9ddd9e3aa9a7558101432f30d0bfa766/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759184567","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012800/a5a936cd9ddd9e3aa9a7558101432f30d0bfa766/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759184567","categories":[{"description":"Additional High-Quality Audio","id":50}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Letters to Arralla's charming soundtrack is a family favourite and our go-to recipe for a refreshing summer salad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ingredients:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 1 cup Enya</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 1/2 cup Eastshade</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 2 tbsp Weetbix commercials</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 1  Alba: A Wildlife Adventure, finely chopped</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 1 tbsp Fleet Foxes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 1 bar of handmade eucalyptus soap</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 1 sprig of My Chemical Romance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 250g odd briefs (any of &quot;stoners jamming in a garage&quot;, &quot;scientist husbands arguing via academic paper&quot;, or &quot;alien shoujo weeb&quot; will do)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Method:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toss all ingredients into one playlist and listen! We hope you enjoy :)</p>","developers":["Little Pink Clouds"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2189310","name":"Letters to Arralla"},"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012800/9e18fdee725e1332c8c4732159a5be2dac6daf2e/header.jpg?t=1759184567","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4012800/2094993982/2d5337a81202e10d1a0dbea7e8e4b53b63f3c9eb/1759183511/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759184565","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4012800/2094993982/2d5337a81202e10d1a0dbea7e8e4b53b63f3c9eb/1759183511/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759184565","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4012800/2094993982/2d5337a81202e10d1a0dbea7e8e4b53b63f3c9eb/1759183511/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759184565","id":257208877,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257208877/movie480.mp4?t=1759184565","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257208877/movie_max.mp4?t=1759184565"},"name":"Letters to Arralla Soundtrack Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic